     1465     IF ERROR-STATUS:ERROR THEN RETURN NO-APPLY.
     1466     DISPLAY
     1467       f-host-code
     1468     WITH FRAME motp-frame.
     1469   end .
     1470   on choose of b-host-code in frame diadoc-frame
     1471   do :
